{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Streaming Platform Manager</strong> puts you in charge of your very own streaming service.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy shows and movies across seven genres, grow your subscriber base, and compete against rival platforms. Every decision matters: invest in blockbusters to grab attention or build a steady library of niche content to secure loyal fans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your finances, watch your market share, and see if you can rise from a small startup to a global entertainment giant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to become the next big streaming empire?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4041330?t=1766502123","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041330/29110774672e3df25668dc6e99d07fddcd42cbba/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766502123","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041330/7de752c89ba621dd966f2f1156b18cd231557b26/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766502123","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041330/7de752c89ba621dd966f2f1156b18cd231557b26/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766502123","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4205300,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Streaming Platform Manager</strong> puts you in charge of your very own streaming service.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy shows and movies across seven genres, grow your subscriber base, and compete against rival platforms. Every decision matters: invest in blockbusters to grab attention or build a steady library of niche content to secure loyal fans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your finances, watch your market share, and see if you can rise from a small startup to a g